{"density":2.8125,"scaledDensity":2.8125,"fontScale":1,"texts":[{"text":"Story Outline & Characters Result","box":[45,-4460,990,46],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_header","window":0},{"text":"Story Outline","box":[90,-4335,900,40],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_label","window":0},{"text":"【A Rash Lie】\nCornered in the hallway by an intrusive colleague, Claire impulsively fabricates a fiercely protective boyfriend to make him back off.\n\n【The Smug Witness】\nClaire's annoying neighbor Liam steps out of his apartment having overheard every word, amused by her reckless fiction.\n\n【A Desperate Offer】\nClaire swallows her pride and attempts to hire Liam to act as her date for an upcoming work dinner.\n\n【Setting the Price】\nLiam rejects her cash offer and instead demands public favors and daily chore duties in exchange for his acting services.\n\n【Sealing the Pact】\nClaire reluctantly agrees to Liam's ridiculous rules, cementing their counterfeit relationship with a strict handshake.\n\n【An Unannounced Arrival】\nBefore they can rehearse their backstory, Claire's suspicious colleague knocks loudly on her door demanding to meet the new boyfriend.\n\nPossible Characters:\n• Claire — Female lead, corporate marketing associate\n• Liam — Male lead, freelance architectural designer across the hall\n• Marcus — Supporting character, intrusive office coworker","box":[90,-4250,900,1892],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":36,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body","window":0},{"text":"Characters Result","box":[90,-2265,900,40],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_characters_label","window":0},{"text":"Claire","box":[90,-1921,248,40],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0},{"text":"Liam","box":[372,-1921,248,40],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0},{"text":"Marcus","box":[654,-1921,248,40],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0},{"text":"Here's your storyboard","box":[45,-1780,990,46],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_card_lead","window":0},{"text":"Storyboard Result","box":[90,-1661,680,40],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_card_header","window":0},{"text":"View more","box":[770,-1663,175,43],"color":"#FF1E9AFF","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_card_view_more","window":0},{"text":"Scene 1 — A Rash Lie","box":[263,-1562,704,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Claire stands pressed flat against her wooden apartment door, her arms folded tightly across her rust-orange cardigan sweater. Marcus stands three feet away in the carpeted hallway in his black leather jacket and dark denim jeans, leaning forward with his head tilted. Soft yellow sconces line the hallway wall between them.","box":[263,-1496,704,130],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 2 — The Smug Witness","box":[263,-1246,704,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Liam leans against the painted wooden frame of his open doorway in his black leather biker jacket and dark slim-fit jeans, both hands tucked into his pockets. Claire stands two paces away in the center of the narrow hallway in her rust-orange cardigan, facing him with a tense posture. The warm ceiling lights cast long shadows between their shoes on the carpet.","box":[263,-1180,704,130],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 3 — A Desperate Offer","box":[263,-930,704,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Inside the minimalist apartment, Liam stands beside an industrial drafting table in his black leather jacket and dark jeans, resting one hand on the wooden tabletop. Claire stands near the closed front door in her rust-orange knit cardigan and navy trousers, holding herself upright with hands clasped in front of her. Overhead spotlight track lighting shines on the wood floor between them.","box":[263,-864,704,130],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 4 — Setting the Price","box":[263,-614,704,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Liam stands one step away from Claire in the apartment living area, meeting her eyes with a calm tilt of his head while dressed in his black biker jacket and black t-shirt. Claire glares up at him in her rust-orange cardigan and dark trousers, her chin raised and her fists loosely clenched at her sides. Warm architectural drafting lamps illuminate the room from the corner.","box":[263,-548,704,130],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 5 — Sealing the Pact","box":[263,-298,704,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Claire and Liam stand face-to-face in the center of the apartment with their right hands clasped in a firm handshake. Claire wears her rust-orange knit cardigan and navy trousers, looking squarely at him with set lips. Liam, in his black leather jacket and dark jeans, holds her hand while maintaining an attentive, steady gaze. The warm indoor lighting catches the silver hoop earring on his ear.","box":[263,-232,704,130],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Scene 6 — An Unannounced Arrival","box":[263,18,704,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_title","window":0},{"text":"Liam and Claire both stand frozen near the apartment entrance. Claire clutches the fabric of her rust-orange cardigan at her chest, staring toward the doorway with wide eyes. Liam stands beside her in his black leather jacket, looking toward the hallway door with a sudden sharp focus. The warm indoor lamp casts a crisp shadow of both figures across the entryway floor.","box":[263,84,704,130],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":3,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_storyboard_scene_summary","window":0},{"text":"Storyboard Preview","box":[90,359,900,40],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_header","window":0},{"text":"Borrowed Boyfriend","box":[361,456,606,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_title","window":0},{"text":"0:40","box":[361,499,606,43],"color":"#FF000000","px":37,"sp":13.16,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_duration","window":0},{"text":"See your story as pictures with a voice telling it. The real video comes next.","box":[361,565,606,85],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_animatic_caption","window":0},{"text":"Standard · Preview - 30 sec","box":[475,948,560,143],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0},{"text":"I'll create a video — give me a moment...","box":[45,1159,990,53],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0},{"text":"Preparing video generation for Borrowed Boyfriend.","box":[90,1302,900,56],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_thinking","window":0},{"text":"28366","box":[605,132,110,46],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":500,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif-medium","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_credit","window":0}],"fills":[{"box":[0,0,1080,2400],"color":"#FF303030","radius":null,"id":null,"window":0},{"box":[0,0,1080,2400],"color":"#FFF9FBFF","radius":null,"id":null,"window":0},{"box":[45,-4380,990,2544],"color":"#FFEAF1FC","r